# U-Boot environment config for fw_printenv/fw_setenv.
#
# Points at the dedicated u-boot-env MTD partition (mtd1) from the DTS:
#   mtd1 = u-boot-env, NOR offset 0x360000, size 0x10000 (64 KB), erase 0x10000.
# fw_* address mtd1 from its own start, so the device-relative offset is 0x0.
#
# Size = U-Boot CONFIG_ENV_SIZE; Erase size = flash sector (S29GL064N has 64 KB
# uniform sectors, which is why the DTS partitions align on 0x10000).
# VERIFY READ-ONLY first: fw_printenv must show a valid env (good CRC) before
# relying on fw_setenv. If the CRC doesn't validate, adjust Size here.
#
# MTD device    Offset    Size      Erase size
/dev/mtd1       0x0       0x10000   0x10000
